    "faq": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "f1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What makes it different?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Most night creams just sit on the surface. Noula's Red Rice Recovery Complex targets the look of tired, depleted skin — restoring the overnight nourishment skin loses with age, so you wake up looking rested, not just moisturised.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Does it work on my skin?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. Noula is formulated for all skin types, including sensitive and reactive skin. It's fragrance-light, non-greasy, and comfortable to wear every night.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I use it?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>As the last step of your evening routine, smooth a small amount over cleansed skin. It absorbs fully overnight — no residue on your pillow.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f4": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long until I see results?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Most women notice softer, fresher-looking skin the first morning. The rested look builds over the following weeks with nightly use.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f5": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is it safe for sensitive skin?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes — no harsh actives, no overnight peel. If you're unsure, patch test behind the ear first.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f6": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How does the guarantee work?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Sleep on it for 90 nights. If you don't look more rested, contact us for a full refund — keep the jar.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
